      "question": "What are the key things to check before renting a house?",
      "answer": "Inspect the structural condition, plumbing fixtures, roof, window locks, and heating equipment across the property. Clarify who handles lawn care, gutter cleaning, snow removal, and seasonal pest control before applying. Verify utility arrangements and find the location of the main water shutoff valve."
